<h2>What's new in v2.7.9</h2>

<h3>Installer is now in Bulgarian, with the right icon</h3>
<p>The dialogs that walk you through the first install on a new Mac
are now written in Bulgarian, and the icon shown in the dialogs is the
familiar <b>Аб</b> app icon instead of the generic AppleScript scroll
that macOS was defaulting to.</p>
<p>(This only affects the first-install DMG — once installed,
LangAutoSwitcher itself is exactly the same as v2.7.8.)</p>
